{
    "title": "Aer Lingus App",
    "description": "Download the Aer Lingus app to book, manage and check in for your trips. Access your boarding passes conveniently, stay in-the-know with live flight updates, enjoy AerClub rewards and more. \r\n\r\nThe Aer Lingus mobile app boasts features that will help save time and improve your booking and travel experience. Customers can search and book the best fares from 170 destinations worldwide, create personal and travel companion profiles, for speedy purchase and check in. You can also add your mobile boarding pass to wallet for easy access through security and while boarding your flight. \r\n \r\n<b>Flights at your fingertips</b>\r\nBooking a trip to your favourite destination has never been easier. Search flights and when you find the one that\u2019s right for you book it on the app using a saved payment card to check out swiftly, safely and securely. Your recent searches will be automatically saved for extra convenience when planning your trip. \r\n \r\n<b>Manage your trip</b>\r\nKeep track of your Aer Lingus flight bookings all in one place, under My Trips. View your upcoming trip details and itinerary, check in for your return trip, reserve a seat or even change your booking if you need to. Having the Aer Lingus app on your device is also a great way to keep informed with check in status, gate numbers and gate changes. \r\n \r\n<b>Your Boarding Pass Kept Safe</b>\r\nCheck in for your flight and store your boarding pass safely in the app or in your device wallet. This digital boarding pass will allow you to travel through the airport quickly, speed up boarding and also reduce paper waste. A simple and speedy check in process with easy access to your boarding passes. And don\u2019t worry about a data connection, your boarding pass is available offline for even more convenience.  \r\n \r\n<b>Stay Updated</b>\r\nGet live flight updates straight to your phone for an easy, stress-free experience catching your flight. We'll send you push notifications straight to your phone to inform you of real-time flight updates, boarding times and gate information. \r\n\r\n<b>Access AerClub</b>\r\nSign up to AerClub and check out your AerClub profile within the app. Use the app to earn, redeem and keep track of your AerClub rewards. You can view your Avios balance, tier credits and status and use your Avios to book reward travel on the app.  \r\n \r\n<b>Inflight Dining & Shopping</b>\r\nBrowse the Inflight magazine at your leisure on or offline on the app. View all our drink, snack and food options available to you on your flight or enjoy luxury shopping at discounted prices with the on-board boutique.\r\n\r\n \r\nPrivacy Statement \r\nhttps://www.aerlingus.com/support/legal/privacy-statement/",
    "descriptionHTML": "Download the Aer Lingus app to book, manage and check in for your trips. Access your boarding passes conveniently, stay in-the-know with live flight updates, enjoy AerClub rewards and more. <br><br>The Aer Lingus mobile app boasts features that will help save time and improve your booking and travel experience. Customers can search and book the best fares from 170 destinations worldwide, create personal and travel companion profiles, for speedy purchase and check in. You can also add your mobile boarding pass to wallet for easy access through security and while boarding your flight. <br> <br><b>Flights at your fingertips</b><br>Booking a trip to your favourite destination has never been easier. Search flights and when you find the one that\u2019s right for you book it on the app using a saved payment card to check out swiftly, safely and securely. Your recent searches will be automatically saved for extra convenience when planning your trip. <br> <br><b>Manage your trip</b><br>Keep track of your Aer Lingus flight bookings all in one place, under My Trips. View your upcoming trip details and itinerary, check in for your return trip, reserve a seat or even change your booking if you need to. Having the Aer Lingus app on your device is also a great way to keep informed with check in status, gate numbers and gate changes. <br> <br><b>Your Boarding Pass Kept Safe</b><br>Check in for your flight and store your boarding pass safely in the app or in your device wallet. This digital boarding pass will allow you to travel through the airport quickly, speed up boarding and also reduce paper waste. A simple and speedy check in process with easy access to your boarding passes. And don\u2019t worry about a data connection, your boarding pass is available offline for even more convenience.  <br> <br><b>Stay Updated</b><br>Get live flight updates straight to your phone for an easy, stress-free experience catching your flight. We&#39;ll send you push notifications straight to your phone to inform you of real-time flight updates, boarding times and gate information. <br><br><b>Access AerClub</b><br>Sign up to AerClub and check out your AerClub profile within the app. Use the app to earn, redeem and keep track of your AerClub rewards. You can view your Avios balance, tier credits and status and use your Avios to book reward travel on the app.  <br> <br><b>Inflight Dining &amp; Shopping</b><br>Browse the Inflight magazine at your leisure on or offline on the app. View all our drink, snack and food options available to you on your flight or enjoy luxury shopping at discounted prices with the on-board boutique.<br><br> <br>Privacy Statement <br>https://www.aerlingus.com/support/legal/privacy-statement/",
